  projectName: Quick Bio
  description: "Game Developer \xB7 Sound Designer \xB7 Unity \xB7 C# \xB7 .NET\n\nHello!
    Thank you for looking at my portfolio - please have a look around!\n\nI'm Thomas
    \u2014 a game developer and sound designer based near Copenhagen. Clean C#, solid
    systems, audio that earns its place. I've shipped games, led teams, and worn
    many different hats across 5+ years of indie, academic, and professional work.\n\nMSc
    Games (ITU Copenhagen) \xB7 Ba. Sound Design. Lately expanding into .NET full-stack
    \u2014 because strong fundamentals travel.\n\nOpen to studio and developer roles.
    Let's talk."
